   "custom_product_subtype": "Cartridges",
   "custom_product_type": "vape",
   "description": "CBC: 0.49% | CBD: 0.14% | CBG: 1.17% | CBGA: 0.35% | THC: 79.56% | THC9: 79.3% | THCA: 0.3% | THCV: 0.32%\r\n--\r\nExperience the purest form of cannabis with our Live Resin. Crafted with precision and years of expertise, we extract from freshly frozen, top-tier flower, capturing the finest attributes of cannabinoids and terpenes. The outcome is a concentrated masterpiece, delivering an unmatched and distinctive bouquet, flavor, and potency in every batch. nuEra vape cartridges feature a highly refined, double-distilled oil containing pure cannabinoids and infused terpenes with no additives or fillers. This extra step of refinement creates a clear viscous oil that resembles maple tree sap in consistency and hue.\n\nRoyal Gorilla is a sativa-dominant hybrid that brings together the powerhouse genetics of GG, GG4, Original Glue, and GG #4\u2014creating a strain that\u2019s as bold as it is balanced. With its unmistakable aroma of citrus zest, pungent diesel, and crisp pine, Royal Gorilla delivers a sensory experience that\u2019s both energizing and grounding. This strain features a dynamic terpene profile led by Myrcene, Caryophyllene, and Limonene, which work in harmony to amplify its vibrant scent and deepen its flavor complexity. The first inhale greets you with a sharp burst of citrus and earthy pine, quickly followed by a robust diesel undertone that adds grit and character to the smoke. It\u2019s a flavor journey that\u2019s punchy, layered, and undeniably memorable. This strain is celebrated for its uplifting yet soothing effects. Users often report a euphoric head high that sparks creativity and focus, while a gentle body buzz brings on a sense of relaxation and tingling calm. It\u2019s a strain that keeps you mentally alert while easing physical tension\u2014perfect for daytime unwinding or social settings where you want to stay engaged but mellow. Whether you're chasing a mood boost, looking to relieve stress, or simply craving a flavorful escape, Royal Gorilla offers a well-rounded high that\u2019s both invigorating and serene. It\u2019s a go-to for those who want the best of both worlds: clarity with calm, energy with ease.",
